// Error message 'has pass more field without dynamic schema' indicates schema validation is working correctly
// This error is generated when data contains fields not defined in collection schema and enableDynamicField is false

// The validation logic (based on error message and Milvus behavior):
// 1. Parse incoming data fields
// 2. Check each field against collection schema
// 3. If field not in schema AND enableDynamicField=false → reject with error 1804
// 4. This is correct behavior - prevents schema corruption from arbitrary field injection
